1
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:05,842
西澳皮爾巴拉，紅土山脈一路綿延到印度洋。
The Pilbara, Western Australia: red ranges running to the Indian Ocean.

2
00:00:06,242 --> 00:00:09,942
這裡的鐵礦石，撐起了全世界的鋼鐵。
Its iron ore holds up much of the world's steel.

3
00:00:16,892 --> 00:00:21,437
約西元前3200年，埃及人用隕鐵打成珠子。
Around 3200 BC, Egyptians hammered meteoritic iron into beads.

4
00:00:21,837 --> 00:00:26,643
約西元前1200年，冶鐵擴散，鐵器時代展開。
From about 1200 BC, iron smelting spread and the Iron Age began.

5
00:00:27,043 --> 00:00:31,822
1856年，貝塞麥煉鋼法讓鋼材首次能大量生產。
In 1856, the Bessemer process made mass-produced steel possible.

6
00:00:33,672 --> 00:00:38,820
1952年，漢考克自述在飛機上發現皮爾巴拉鐵礦。
In 1952, Lang Hancock said he spotted Pilbara ore from his plane.

7
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:44,204
1960年，澳洲部分解除1938年起的出口禁令。
In 1960, Australia partly lifted an export ban in place since 1938.

8
00:00:46,054 --> 00:00:51,598
美國地質調查局估計，2025年澳洲產量約9.8億噸。
USGS estimates Australia mined about 980 million tonnes in 2025.

9
00:00:51,998 --> 00:00:56,218
居全球第一，約占全球26億噸的三成八。
The world's largest, about 38% of the 2.6 billion tonne total.

10
00:00:56,618 --> 00:01:01,838
黑德蘭港一年吞吐約5.78億噸，98.5%是鐵礦。
Port Hedland handled 577.7 Mt in 2024-25; 98.5% was iron ore.

11
00:01:02,238 --> 00:01:07,387
最大買家在中國，2024年中國粗鋼產量逾10億噸。
China is the main buyer; it made over 1 billion tonnes of steel in 2024.

12
00:01:09,237 --> 00:01:15,112
世界銀行數據：2013年鐵礦石年均價約135美元。
World Bank data: iron ore averaged about US$135/t in 2013.

13
00:01:15,512 --> 00:01:21,380
中國需求放緩、供給大增，2015年底跌到40.5美元。
Slowing Chinese demand and rising supply cut it to US$40.5 by Dec 2015.

14
00:01:21,780 --> 00:01:27,886
2019年巴西淡水河谷尾礦壩潰決，供給吃緊，價格回升。
In 2019, Vale's Brumadinho dam collapse tightened supply; prices rose.

15
00:01:28,286 --> 00:01:33,124
2021年6月，月均價衝上214.4美元。
In June 2021, the monthly average hit US$214.4.

16
00:01:33,524 --> 00:01:38,154
到了2026年10月，回落到每噸90.8美元。
By October 2026, it had eased to US$90.8 per tonne.

17
00:01:40,004 --> 00:01:44,777
皮爾巴拉海岸，是澳洲最常遭熱帶氣旋侵襲的地方。
The Pilbara coast is Australia's most cyclone-prone region.

18
00:01:45,177 --> 00:01:50,568
2019年氣旋韋羅妮卡，力拓估計減產約1,400萬噸。
2019, Cyclone Veronica: Rio Tinto estimated a ~14 Mt production loss.

19
00:01:50,968 --> 00:01:56,030
2023年氣旋伊爾莎，黑德蘭港暫停裝船約兩天。
2023, Cyclone Ilsa: Port Hedland stopped loading for about two days.

20
00:01:56,430 --> 00:02:01,775
2025年第一季，四個氣旋讓力拓損失約1,300萬噸。
Q1 2025: four cyclones cost Rio Tinto about 13 Mt of shipments.

21
00:02:02,175 --> 00:02:07,788
2026年第一季，氣旋米契爾與娜瑞兒再影響約800萬噸。
Q1 2026: Cyclones Mitchell and Narelle hit about 8 Mt more.

22
00:02:09,638 --> 00:02:14,617
幾內亞西芒杜礦已出貨，規劃年產能1.2億噸。
Guinea's Simandou has begun shipping; planned capacity 120 Mt a year.

23
00:02:15,017 --> 00:02:20,371
澳洲政府預估，2031年實質價格約降至64美元。
Australia's government forecasts ~US$64/t in real terms by 2031.

24
00:02:20,771 --> 00:02:26,330
綠色煉鋼常需含鐵67%以上的礦，皮爾巴拉正尋求升級。
Green DRI steel often needs ore above 67% Fe; the Pilbara seeks upgrades.

25
00:02:28,480 --> 00:02:33,647
從一顆隕鐵珠到萬噸巨輪，鐵礦石始終伴著人類前行。
From a meteorite bead to giant ore carriers, iron has walked beside us.

